      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i'm just standing in the middle of the train station at rush hour and it hits me... like, there are thousands of people walking past me and i could literally just disappear right now and the flow of the crowd wouldn't even stutter. it’s like i’m already invisible. just a ghost in a suit.",
