      "content": "idk if \"liberating\" is the right word for it. it feels more like... emptiness. like there's no point in trying to be seen or heard when the city just swallows everything up. if i stopped showing up to work or stopped answering my phone, the world would just keep spinning like nothing ever happened. it makes everything feel so pointless.",
